{
  "name": "Illusory Dragon",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A Huge, tangible shadow dragon (immune to all damage and conditions) appears within 120 ft while you concentrate (up to 1 minute; place a token if you like). Enemies that can see it make a WIS save or drop what they hold and are Frightened (a creature ending its turn without line of sight to it repeats the save - by hand). As a Bonus Action, move it up to 60 ft and have it exhale a 60-ft Cone: INT save, 6d6 damage of the type you chose when creating it (Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Necrotic or Poison), half on a success. Creatures that see through the illusion have Advantage on those saves.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
